      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the kidneys but my doctor hasn't mentioned anything about magnesium specifically, just that i need to watch my salt and stuff. if i only took like 500mg or 600mg every other day instead of the full 1000mg every day, would that be safer? i'm just really desperate to get some sleep without the twitching. i dont think i need to go to a whole doctor's appointment just for a supplement, right?",
