      "content": "i mean i hear you, but i just dont have the time or the money to go in for an appointment right now for something that seems so simple. i've been reading some wellness blogs and people are saying that if u just start with a very small dose, like 100mg or 200mg, it's basically impossible to overdose or mess up your kidneys. if i just stick to a tiny amount to help me sleep, is there really a reason to delay it and keep suffering through these cramps? it seems like a low risk.",
